{'symbol': 'NDAQ', 'date': '2022-10-25 16:40:00', 'title': 'NASDAQ ANNOUNCES MID-MONTH OPEN SHORT INTEREST POSITIONS IN NASDAQ STOCKS AS OF SETTLEMENT DATE OCTOBER 14, 2022', 'text': 'NEW YORK, OCT. 25, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- AT THE END OF THE SETTLEMENT DATE OF OCTOBER 14, 2022, SHORT INTEREST IN 3,446 NASDAQ GLOBAL MARKETSM SECURITIES TOTALED 10,553,498,844 SHARES COMPARED WITH 10,500,336,239 SHARES IN 3,450 GLOBAL MARKET ISSUES REPORTED FOR THE PRIOR SETTLEMENT DATE OF SEPTEMBER 30, 2022. THE MID-OCTOBER SHORT INTEREST REPRESENTS 2.96 DAYS COMPARED WITH 2.80 DAYS FOR THE PRIOR REPORTING PERIOD.'}